  "lines": [
    {
      "line_id": "line_0",
      "speaker_id": "350c9586-c357-4c96-a7b7-00ad01624315",
      "speaker_name": "Avery Kim ",
      "text": "Hey team, quick audio check. Can everyone hear me okay?",
      "start_sec": 0.0,
      "end_sec": 3.0,
      "audio_file": "line_0.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_1",
      "speaker_id": "64e853ff-cca1-4340-9e18-1ac1e4ef0044",
      "speaker_name": "Diego Martinez ",
      "text": "Loud and clear!",
      "start_sec": 3.6,
      "end_sec": 5.1,
      "audio_file": "line_1.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_2",
      "speaker_id": "bd5f1579-9865-4300-bc62-78a35551eee1",
      "speaker_name": "Priya Shah",
      "text": "Yep, I'm good.",
      "start_sec": 5.5,
      "end_sec": 7.0,
      "audio_file": "line_2.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_3",
      "speaker_id": "350c9586-c357-4c96-a7b7-00ad01624315",
      "speaker_name": "Avery Kim ",
      "text": "Alright, let's jump in. We've got a bit of a challenge with Mario Kart's new user growth.",
      "start_sec": 7.5,
      "end_sec": 12.0,
      "audio_file": "line_3.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_4",
      "speaker_id": "350c9586-c357-4c96-a7b7-00ad01624315",
      "speaker_name": "Avery Kim ",
      "text": "It's down 10% from last month, which isn't ideal.",
      "start_sec": 12.5,
      "end_sec": 16.0,
      "audio_file": "line_4.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_5",
      "speaker_id": "e6a4b557-bd5c-4833-b380-2b8cd227b018",
      "speaker_name": "Leo Anderson ",
      "text": "Yeah, that's what we're looking to turn around.",
      "start_sec": 16.5,
      "end_sec": 19.5,
      "audio_file": "line_5.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_6",
      "speaker_id": "350c9586-c357-4c96-a7b7-00ad01624315",
      "speaker_name": "Avery Kim ",
      "text": "Exactly. To tackle this, we're launching a limited-time event.",
      "start_sec": 20.0,
      "end_sec": 24.0,
      "audio_file": "line_6.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_7",
      "speaker_id": "350c9586-c357-4c96-a7b7-00ad01624315",
      "speaker_name": "Avery Kim ",
      "text": "It's called 'Mario Kart Shell Showdown'.",
      "start_sec": 24.5,
      "end_sec": 27.0,
      "audio_file": "line_7.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_8",
      "speaker_id": "64e853ff-cca1-4340-9e18-1ac1e4ef0044",
      "speaker_name": "Diego Martinez ",
      "text": "Oh, the blue shell only one? That's gonna be chaos!",
      "start_sec": 27.5,
      "end_sec": 31.5,
      "audio_file": "line_8.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_9",
      "speaker_id": "bd5f1579-9865-4300-bc62-78a35551eee1",
      "speaker_name": "Priya Shah",
      "text": "Sounds fun, actually.",
      "start_sec": 31.9,
      "end_sec": 33.9,
      "audio_file": "line_9.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_10",
      "speaker_id": "350c9586-c357-4c96-a7b7-00ad01624315",
      "speaker_name": "Avery Kim ",
      "text": "Chaos we can market! Leo, can you walk us through the goals for this?",
      "start_sec": 34.4,
      "end_sec": 38.4,
      "audio_file": "line_10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_11",
      "speaker_id": "e6a4b557-bd5c-4833-b380-2b8cd227b018",
      "speaker_name": "Leo Anderson ",
      "text": "Sure thing. We're aiming for a 15% increase in new user growth.",
      "start_sec": 39.0,
      "end_sec": 43.0,
      "audio_file": "line_11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_12",
      "speaker_id": "e6a4b557-bd5c-4833-b380-2b8cd227b018",
      "speaker_name": "Leo Anderson ",
      "text": "And we also want to boost our daily active users by 10%.",
      "start_sec": 43.5,
      "end_sec": 47.5,
      "audio_file": "line_12.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_13",
      "speaker_id": "bd5f1579-9865-4300-bc62-78a35551eee1",
      "speaker_name": "Priya Shah",
      "text": "Those are solid targets.",
      "start_sec": 48.0,
      "end_sec": 50.5,
      "audio_file": "line_13.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_14",
      "speaker_id": "e6a4b557-bd5c-4833-b380-2b8cd227b018",
      "speaker_name": "Leo Anderson ",
      "text": "The main challenge is building a breakthrough multi-channel campaign.",
      "start_sec": 51.0,
      "end_sec": 55.5,
      "audio_file": "line_14.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_15",
      "speaker_id": "e6a4b557-bd5c-4833-b380-2b8cd227b018",
      "speaker_name": "Leo Anderson ",
      "text": "It needs to drive awareness, engagement, and measurable results.",
      "start_sec": 56.0,
      "end_sec": 60.0,
      "audio_file": "line_15.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_16",
      "speaker_id": "64e853ff-cca1-4340-9e18-1ac1e4ef0044",
      "speaker_name": "Diego Martinez ",
      "text": "And keep that Mario Kart feel, right? Brand consistency is key.",
      "start_sec": 60.5,
      "end_sec": 65.0,
      "audio_file": "line_16.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_17",
      "speaker_id": "350c9586-c357-4c96-a7b7-00ad01624315",
      "speaker_name": "Avery Kim ",
      "text": "Spot on, Diego. So, how are we thinking about approaching this?",
      "start_sec": 65.5,
      "end_sec": 69.5,
      "audio_file": "line_17.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_18",
      "speaker_id": "64e853ff-cca1-4340-9e18-1ac1e4ef0044",
      "speaker_name": "Diego Martinez ",
      "text": "I think we really lean into the 'multi-channel' part. We need to hit everywhere.",
      "start_sec": 70.1,
      "end_sec": 74.6,
      "audio_file": "line_18.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_19",
      "speaker_id": "64e853ff-cca1-4340-9e18-1ac1e4ef0044",
      "speaker_name": "Diego Martinez ",
      "text": "And definitely keep those measurable results in mind from the start.",
      "start_sec": 75.1,
      "end_sec": 79.1,
      "audio_file": "line_19.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_20",
      "speaker_id": "bd5f1579-9865-4300-bc62-78a35551eee1",
      "speaker_name": "Priya Shah",
      "text": "We should also ensure all our messaging feels consistent with the brand.",
      "start_sec": 79.6,
      "end_sec": 84.1,
      "audio_file": "line_20.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_21",
      "speaker_id": "e6a4b557-bd5c-4833-b380-2b8cd227b018",
      "speaker_name": "Leo Anderson ",
      "text": "Yeah, that's crucial. We can't stray too far.",
      "start_sec": 84.6,
      "end_sec": 88.1,
      "audio_file": "line_21.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_22",
      "speaker_id": "64e853ff-cca1-4340-9e18-1ac1e4ef0044",
      "speaker_name": "Diego Martinez ",
      "text": "Right. We'll build out the campaign from there, always checking against those goals.",
      "start_sec": 88.6,
      "end_sec": 93.6,
      "audio_file": "line_22.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_23",
      "speaker_id": "350c9586-c357-4c96-a7b7-00ad01624315",
      "speaker_name": "Avery Kim ",
      "text": "Okay, let's talk about what we'll actually be producing. Deliverables.",
      "start_sec": 94.1,
      "end_sec": 98.6,
      "audio_file": "line_23.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_24",
      "speaker_id": "bd5f1579-9865-4300-bc62-78a35551eee1",
      "speaker_name": "Priya Shah",
      "text": "First, we'll need that Marketing Campaign Report, I think?",
      "start_sec": 99.1,
      "end_sec": 103.1,
      "audio_file": "line_24.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_25",
      "speaker_id": "e6a4b557-bd5c-4833-b380-2b8cd227b018",
      "speaker_name": "Leo Anderson ",
      "text": "Definitely. And a strategy presentation outlining everything.",
      "start_sec": 103.69999999999999,
      "end_sec": 107.69999999999999,
      "audio_file": "line_25.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_26",
      "speaker_id": "64e853ff-cca1-4340-9e18-1ac1e4ef0044",
      "speaker_name": "Diego Martinez ",
      "text": "So, those two main outputs, then. Got it.",
      "start_sec": 108.19999999999999,
      "end_sec": 111.69999999999999,
      "audio_file": "line_26.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_27",
      "speaker_id": "350c9586-c357-4c96-a7b7-00ad01624315",
      "speaker_name": "Avery Kim ",
      "text": "Exactly. Those are our key outputs for this.",
      "start_sec": 112.19999999999999,
      "end_sec": 115.69999999999999,
      "audio_file": "line_27.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_28",
      "speaker_id": "350c9586-c357-4c96-a7b7-00ad01624315",
      "speaker_name": "Avery Kim ",
      "text": "Alright team, that covers the kickoff. Let's get this into a formal brief.",
      "start_sec": 116.19999999999999,
      "end_sec": 120.69999999999999,
      "audio_file": "line_28.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_29",
      "speaker_id": "350c9586-c357-4c96-a7b7-00ad01624315",
      "speaker_name": "Avery Kim ",
      "text": "We'll circle back soon to review initial concepts.",
      "start_sec": 121.19999999999999,
      "end_sec": 125.19999999999999,
      "audio_file": "line_29.mp3"
    },
    {
      "line_id": "line_30",
      "speaker_id": "64e853ff-cca1-4340-9e18-1ac1e4ef0044",
      "speaker_name": "Diego Martinez ",
      "text": "Sounds like a plan!",
      "start_sec": 125.69999999999999,
      "end_sec": 127.69999999999999,
      "audio_file": "line_30.mp3"
    }
  ]
}